ine limit.\n3. **Readiness gaps:** every pending prebuild gap from the day18 list had already been built, so I removed those and added 10 new ones that haven't been built. The six priority-1 gaps are `utf-family-sweep`, `base64-utf16le`, `endian-word-swap`, `wide-int-charcodes`, `hexdump-formats` and `binary-lsb-first`. I also added a note about Mastery solve time, which keeps growing as days add lines. The JSON parses and keeps the same keys."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1128,"cache_read_input_tokens":99554,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1128},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a3998553-dd92-4aba-82dd-28852dfc57a2","uuid":"d0e71dc5-8614-4448-978d-a80985e58c1f","timestamp":"2026-10-19T13:07:18.180Z","request_id":"req_011CgBeTvfFpuBngrGXDCx8a"}
